  "title": "Quick and Easy Peach Pie Egg Rolls with Raspberry Sauce",
  "description": "This creative combination of ingredients just may prove to be your new favorite dessert! Egg roll wrappers are filled with a peach pie mixture, deep fried, and served over ice cream with a rich sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "COUSINDILL"
  ],
